## Refined Onboarding (6 Steps, Not 8)

Previous plan had 8 steps — too many. Research shows every additional step loses ~15% of users.

### Step 1 — Phone Login (30 sec)
- Firebase Phone OTP (you already have this set up)
- One-tap Google/Facebook as alternatives
- No email, no password. PIN-based re-login later.

### Step 2 — Name + Type (30 sec)
- **Combined screen**: Store name input at top, business type tiles below
- Auto-generates slug with availability check
- Selecting type pre-loads everything (template, categories, placeholder content)

### Step 3 — Pick Your Look (45 sec)
- **Theme Selection**: 3-4 layout styles per store type (not just colors)
- **Color Palette**: 8 curated palettes + "Custom" option with color picker
- **Live Preview**: Tiny phone mockup updates in real-time as they tap
- Font is auto-selected based on palette (no decision fatigue)

### Step 4 — Your Storefront (45 sec)
- Hero image: Camera / Gallery / Free stock photos (filtered by store type)
- Headline + Subheadline (pre-filled with AI suggestion in Bengali)
- One-tap to accept suggestion or type custom

### Step 5 — Payments (30 sec)
- Toggle: bKash | Nagad | COD (pre-checked based on store type)
- Just enter merchant number. Done.
- "Set up automated payments later" link for advanced users

### Step 6 — LIVE! 🎉 (15 sec)
- Confetti + celebration screen
- Store URL in large text with copy button
- **Share to WhatsApp** (pre-filled message: "আমার নতুন দোকান দেখুন! 🛍️ [URL]")
- **Share to Facebook**
- "Add your first product" CTA button

**Total: ~3 minutes. Two fewer steps than before.**

