## What Competitors Are Missing (Your Moat)

Based on research into eBitans, eDokan, DeshiCommerce, and global platforms:

### vs. Local BD Competitors (eBitans, eDokan, DeshiCommerce)
| Gap in Their Product | Your Advantage |
|---|---|
| No in-site visual editing | **Tap-to-Edit live builder** |
| Template selection is final, limited customization | **Every section editable, reorderable, removable** |
| Desktop-first admin panels | **Mobile-native admin built for thumb navigation** |
| No AI features | **Bengali AI copywriting, Voice-to-Product** |
| No version history | **Undo/redo with revision snapshots** |
| Basic analytics | **Simple but actionable insights (not GA complexity)** |
| No blog system | **Built-in SEO-optimized blog** |

### vs. Global Platforms (Shopify, Wix)
| Gap in Their Product | Your Advantage |
|---|---|
| Expensive (৳3,500+/mo) | **Free tier, paid from ৳499/mo** |
| No native bKash/Nagad | **Built-in, zero config** |
| No Bengali UI | **Full Bengali admin + storefront** |
| No Pathao/Steadfast integration | **One-tap courier booking** |
| Desktop-required for editing | **100% mobile editing** |
| No payment screenshot verification | **Built-in for BD workflow** |

