## New Features (Not in Previous Plan)

### 1. Staff & Team Accounts
```
Owner → Full access to everything
Manager → Products, Orders, Analytics (no billing/theme)
Staff → View orders, update stock, respond to messages
```
- Invite via phone number (not email)
- Per-permission toggles on mobile

### 2. Blog & Content Marketing
- Simple markdown editor optimized for mobile
- AI-generated blog posts from product descriptions
- Auto-SEO: title tags, meta descriptions, Open Graph
- Schedule posts for future publishing

### 3. Store Health Score
A gamified dashboard widget that scores 0-100:
- ✅ Has logo (+10)
- ✅ Has 5+ products (+15)
- ✅ Payment method configured (+10)
- ✅ Custom domain connected (+10)
- ✅ Has at least 1 blog post (+5)
- ⚠️ Missing product descriptions (-10)
- ⚠️ No social links (-5)
Shows specific action items to improve. Drives feature adoption.

### 4. Smart Notifications (Not Just Alerts)
Instead of dumb push notifications:
- "তোমার সেরা পণ্য 'Blue Saree' গত ৩ দিনে ১৫ বার দেখা হয়েছে কিন্তু কেউ কেনেনি। দাম কমানোর কথা ভাবছ?" (Your top product was viewed 15 times but nobody bought it. Consider lowering the price?)
- "গত সপ্তাহে ৫ জন কাস্টমার কার্টে পণ্য রেখে চলে গেছে। WhatsApp রিমাইন্ডার পাঠাবে?" (5 customers abandoned carts. Send WhatsApp reminder?)

### 5. Import/Migration Tools
- CSV import for products (with column mapping UI)
- Import from eBitans / eDokan (if they expose data)
- Import from Shopify CSV export format
- Import from Facebook Shop catalog

### 6. Subscription & Recurring Products
- Weekly meal plans, monthly beauty boxes, etc.
- Customer subscribes → auto-order created on schedule
- bKash recurring payment or manual reminder via WhatsApp

### 7. Multi-Page Support
Not just homepage — merchants need:
- `/about` — About Us page
- `/contact` — Contact with map
- `/blog` — Blog listing
- `/policy` — Return/Refund policy
- Custom pages via the visual builder

### 8. Webhook & API System
```
POST /api/v1/webhooks/order.created
POST /api/v1/webhooks/order.shipped
POST /api/v1/webhooks/product.updated
```
- Allows third-party integrations (accounting software, custom apps)
- Essential for enterprise customers and reseller partners

### 9. Abandoned Cart Recovery
- Automatic detection: cart items + phone number + no order within 2 hours
- One-tap "Send WhatsApp Reminder" from admin dashboard
- Auto-send option (premium feature): system sends reminder via WhatsApp Business API
- Pre-written Bengali reminder template with product images

### 10. QR Code Generator
- Auto-generated QR code for the store URL
- Printable QR cards for physical distribution (market stalls, flyers)
- QR code for individual products
- Essential for BD sellers who hand out physical cards at markets

