## Revised Pricing (Sustainable)

Previous pricing was too cheap to sustain. Based on BD market research:

| Plan | Price/month | Products | Key Features |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Free** | ৳০ | 10 | Subdomain only, COD only, basic template, platform watermark |
| **Starter** | ৳499 | 100 | Custom domain, bKash/Nagad manual, remove watermark, blog |
| **Growth** | ৳999 | Unlimited | bKash automated, analytics, WhatsApp orders, staff accounts (2), abandoned cart |
| **Business** | ৳1,999 | Unlimited | Everything + courier API, 5 staff, priority support, API access, no transaction fee |

### Transaction Fee Strategy
- **Free plan**: 2% per order (incentivizes upgrading)
- **Starter**: 1% per order
- **Growth+**: 0% platform fee (only payment gateway fees)

### Why This Works
- Free plan has enough friction (watermark, 10 products, 2% fee) to drive upgrades
- ৳499 Starter is cheaper than a single Pathao delivery — affordable for any seller
- ৳1,999 Business is still 40% cheaper than Shopify Basic

